{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Create Custom Dataframes and Export to Cassandra Tables\n### Ref. '2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk' in report.\n___\n**Note**  \nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:\n1. [1_TLC_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n2. [2_TLC_Frame_to_Table](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n3. [3_TLC_Cassandra_Queries](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC)\n___\nThis notebook covers the following actions:\n- Import TLC related data and prepare a raw dataframe. Here redundant rows are removed before a final raw dataframe is created.\n- Final raw dataframe is used to create customised sub dataframes for Cassandra tables.\n- Customised dataframes are beeing exported to their respective Cassandra tables.\n\nSince the `mode` for writing data to tables are sett to `append`, this notebook can be run several times without creating problems.  \nIf new data is presented to the TLC then this wll be appended to the tables.  \nIf identical data allready exist in a table then nothing will change.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T01:49:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762477975687_25295556","id":"paragraph_1762477975687_25295556","dateCreated":"2025-11-07T01:12:55+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-07T01:49:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T01:49:54+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Create Custom Dataframes and Export to Cassandra Tables</h1>\n<h3>Ref. &lsquo;2.4 Cassandra Database Design og Bruk&rsquo; in report.</h3>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note</strong><br />\nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC\">1_TLC_CQL_DB_Build.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC\">2_TLC_Frame_to_Table</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC\">3_TLC_Cassandra_Queries</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>This notebook covers the following actions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Import TLC related data and prepare a raw dataframe. Here redundant rows are removed before a final raw dataframe is created.</li>\n<li>Final raw dataframe is used to create customised sub dataframes for Cassandra tables.</li>\n<li>Customised dataframes are beeing exported to their respective Cassandra tables.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Since the <code>mode</code> for writing data to tables are sett to <code>append</code>, this notebook can be run several times without creating problems.<br />\nIf new data is presented to the TLC then this wll be appended to the tables.<br />\nIf identical data allready exist in a table then nothing will change.</p>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### Import data and prepare for export\nHere is a compact version of the import and handeling of redundant rows which is beeing covered in the notebook [Milestone1_TLC_Main_spark.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC), Ref '2.2 Analyse av TLC Datasett' in report.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T01:12:21+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Import data and prepare for export</h3>\n<p>Here is a compact version of the import and handeling of redundant rows which is beeing covered in the notebook <a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/TLC\">Milestone1_TLC_Main_spark.zpln</a>, Ref &lsquo;2.2 Analyse av TLC Datasett&rsquo; in report.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762477483976_1528295045","id":"paragraph_1762477483976_1528295045","dateCreated":"2025-11-07T01:04:44+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T01:12:21+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-07T01:12:22+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\r\nimport spark.implicits._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\r\n\r\n// Import TLC data:\r\nval refPath = \"/sparkio/TLC/trips/2025/yellow_tripdata_2025-01.parquet\"\r\nval refSchema = spark.read.parquet(refPath).schema\r\nval base = (\"/sparkio/TLC/trips/2025/yellow*.parquet\")\r\nval tlc_df_raw = spark.read\r\n\t.option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\r\n\t.schema(refSchema)\r\n\t.parquet(base)\r\n\r\n// Import of MapZone data:\r\nval zoneBase = (\"/sparkio/TLC/mapZones/taxi_zone_lookup.csv\")\r\nval zoneSchema = StructType(Array(\r\n    StructField(\"LocationID\", IntegerType, true),\r\n    StructField(\"Borough\", StringType, true),\r\n    StructField(\"Zone\", StringType, true),\r\n    StructField(\"service_zone\", StringType, true)\r\n))\r\nval dfZone = spark.read\r\n\t.option(\"header\", \"true\")\r\n    .schema(zoneSchema)\r\n    .csv(zoneBase)\r\n\r\n// TLC parquet dataTypes correction:\r\nval typeFix = tlc_df_raw\r\n    .withColumn(\"VendorID\", col(\"VendorID\").cast(\"byte\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"tpep_pickup_datetime\", col(\"tpep_pickup_datetime\").cast(\"timestamp\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"tpep_dropoff_datetime\", col(\"tpep_dropoff_datetime\").cast(\"timestamp\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"passenger_count\", col(\"passenger_count\").cast(\"byte\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"RatecodeID\", col(\"RatecodeID\").cast(\"byte\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"store_and_fwd_flag\", (col(\"store_and_fwd_flag\") === lit(\"Y\")).cast(\"boolean\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"payment_type\", col(\"payment_type\").cast(\"byte\"))\r\n\r\n// Adding time columns to TLC df.\r\nval dfWithSpeed = typeFix\r\n    .withColumn(\"pickup_day\", col(\"tpep_pickup_datetime\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"dropoff_day\", col(\"tpep_dropoff_datetime\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"pickup_sec\",  col(\"tpep_pickup_datetime\").cast(\"long\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"dropoff_sec\", col(\"tpep_dropoff_datetime\").cast(\"long\"))\r\n    // duration in hours.\r\n    .withColumn(\"duration_hours\",\r\n      (col(\"dropoff_sec\") - col(\"pickup_sec\")) / 3600.0\r\n    )\r\n    // speed = miles / hours.\r\n    .withColumn(\r\n      \"Speed_miles_pr_hour\",\r\n      when(col(\"duration_hours\") > 0,\r\n           col(\"trip_distance\") / col(\"duration_hours\")\r\n      ).otherwise(lit(null).cast(\"double\"))\r\n    )\r\n    // Travel duration in minutes.\r\n    .withColumn(\r\n        \"trip_duration_min\",\r\n        when(not(col(\"duration_hours\").isNull),\r\n            col(\"duration_hours\") * 60\r\n        ).otherwise(lit(null).cast(\"double\"))\r\n    )\r\n    .drop(\"pickup_sec\",\"dropoff_sec\",\"duration_hours\")\r\n    .withColumn(\"Speed_miles_pr_hour\", round(col(\"Speed_miles_pr_hour\"), 2))\r\n    .withColumn(\"trip_duration_min\", round(col(\"trip_duration_min\"), 2))\r\n    .withColumn(\"hour_of_day\", date_format(col(\"pickup_day\"), \"k\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"pickup_day\", dayofweek(col(\"pickup_day\")))\r\n    .withColumn(\"dropoff_day\", dayofweek(col(\"dropoff_day\")))\r\n\r\n// Remove redundant rows:\r\nval dfWithSpeedRmHighSpeedAndNull = dfWithSpeed.filter(col(\"Speed_miles_pr_hour\") <= 80)\r\nval PositiveFare = dfWithSpeedRmHighSpeedAndNull.filter(col(\"total_amount\") > 0)\r\nval passengerMoreThanZero = PositiveFare.filter(col(\"passenger_count\") > 0)\r\n\r\n// Join operation on TLC and Zones data:\r\nval tlc_final =\r\n  passengerMoreThanZero.alias(\"m\")\r\n    .join(dfZone.alias(\"zpu\"),\r\n        col(\"m.PULocationID\") === col(\"zpu.LocationID\"),\r\n        \"left\")\r\n    .join(dfZone.alias(\"zdo\"),\r\n        col(\"m.DOLocationID\") === col (\"zdo.LocationID\"),\r\n        \"left\")\r\n    .select(col(\"m.*\"),\r\n        col(\"zpu.Zone\").as(\"pickup_location_name\"),\r\n        col(\"zpu.Borough\").as(\"PU_Borough\"),\r\n        col(\"zdo.Zone\").as(\"dropoff_location_name\"),\r\n        col(\"zdo.Borough\").as(\"DO_Borough\"))\r\n    .withColumnRenamed(\"tpep_pickup_datetime\", \"pickup_date\")\r\n    .withColumnRenamed(\"tpep_dropoff_datetime\", \"dropoff_date\")\r\n\r\n// Simple validation on final result:\r\nprint(\"Number under should be 20622905(If new data is introduced to TLC, this will not match).\\n\")\r\nprint(tlc_final.count())\r\nprint(\"\\nSmall controll on datatypes:\\n\")\r\nprint(tlc_final.printSchema())\r\nprint(\"\\n Overview of the main TLC df:\\n\")\r\ntlc_final.show(3, truncate = false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:01+0000","progress":100,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"Number under should be 20622905(If new data is introduced to TLC, this will not match).\n20622905\nSmall controll on datatypes:\nroot\n |-- VendorID: byte (nullable = true)\n |-- pickup_date: timestamp (nullable = true)\n |-- dropoff_date: timestamp (nullable = true)\n |-- passenger_count: byte (nullable = true)\n |-- trip_distance: double (nullable = true)\n |-- RatecodeID: byte (nullable = true)\n |-- store_and_fwd_flag: boolean (nullable = true)\n |-- PULocationID: integer (nullable = true)\n |-- DOLocationID: integer (nullable = true)\n |-- payment_type: byte (nullable = true)\n |-- fare_amount: double (nullable = true)\n |-- extra: double (nullable = true)\n |-- mta_tax: double (nullable = true)\n |-- tip_amount: double (nullable = true)\n |-- tolls_amount: double (nullable = true)\n |-- improvement_surcharge: double (nullable = true)\n |-- total_amount: double (nullable = true)\n |-- congestion_surcharge: double (nullable = true)\n |-- Airport_fee: double (nullable = true)\n |-- cbd_congestion_fee: double (nullable = true)\n |-- pickup_day: integer (nullable = true)\n |-- dropoff_day: integer (nullable = true)\n |-- Speed_miles_pr_hour: double (nullable = true)\n |-- trip_duration_min: double (nullable = true)\n |-- hour_of_day: string (nullable = true)\n |-- pickup_location_name: string (nullable = true)\n |-- PU_Borough: string (nullable = true)\n |-- dropoff_location_name: string (nullable = true)\n |-- DO_Borough: string (nullable = true)\n\n()\n Overview of the main TLC df:\n+--------+-------------------+-------------------+---------------+-------------+----------+------------------+------------+------------+------------+-----------+-----+-------+----------+------------+---------------------+------------+--------------------+-----------+------------------+----------+-----------+-------------------+-----------------+-----------+--------------------+----------+---------------------+----------+\n|VendorID|pickup_date        |dropoff_date       |passenger_count|trip_distance|RatecodeID|store_and_fwd_flag|PULocationID|DOLocationID|payment_type|fare_amount|extra|mta_tax|tip_amount|tolls_amount|improvement_surcharge|total_amount|congestion_surcharge|Airport_fee|cbd_congestion_fee|pickup_day|dropoff_day|Speed_miles_pr_hour|trip_duration_min|hour_of_day|pickup_location_name|PU_Borough|dropoff_location_name|DO_Borough|\n+--------+-------------------+-------------------+---------------+-------------+----------+------------------+------------+------------+------------+-----------+-----+-------+----------+------------+---------------------+------------+--------------------+-----------+------------------+----------+-----------+-------------------+-----------------+-----------+--------------------+----------+---------------------+----------+\n|1       |2025-05-01 00:07:06|2025-05-01 00:24:15|1              |3.7          |1         |false             |140         |202         |1           |18.4       |4.25 |0.5    |4.85      |0.0         |1.0                  |29.0        |2.5                 |0.0        |0.75              |5         |5          |12.94              |17.15            |24         |Lenox Hill East     |Manhattan |Roosevelt Island     |Manhattan |\n|2       |2025-05-01 00:07:44|2025-05-01 00:14:27|1              |1.03         |1         |false             |234         |161         |1           |8.6        |1.0  |0.5    |4.3       |0.0         |1.0                  |18.65       |2.5                 |0.0        |0.75              |5         |5          |9.2                |6.72             |24         |Union Sq            |Manhattan |Midtown Center       |Manhattan |\n|2       |2025-05-01 00:15:56|2025-05-01 00:23:53|1              |1.57         |1         |false             |161         |234         |2           |10.0       |1.0  |0.5    |0.0       |0.0         |1.0                  |15.75       |2.5                 |0.0        |0.75              |5         |5          |11.85              |7.95             |24         |Midtown Center      |Manhattan |Union Sq             |Manhattan |\n+--------+-------------------+-------------------+---------------+-------------+----------+------------------+------------+------------+------------+-----------+-----+-------+----------+------------+---------------------+------------+--------------------+-----------+------------------+----------+-----------+-------------------+-----------------+-----------+--------------------+----------+---------------------+----------+\nonly showing top 3 rows\n\nimport spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mrefPath\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/TLC/trips/2025/yellow_tripdata_2025-01.parquet\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mrefSchema\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.types.StructType\u001b[0m = StructType(StructField(VendorID,IntegerType,true),StructField(tpep_pickup_datetime,TimestampNTZType,true),StructField(tpep_dropoff_datetime,TimestampNTZType,true),StructField(passenger_count,LongType,true),StructField(trip_distance,DoubleType,true),StructField(RatecodeID,LongType,true),StructField(store_and_fwd_flag,StringType,true),StructField(PULocationID,IntegerType,true),StructField(DOLocationID,IntegerType,true),StructField(payment_type,LongType,true),StructField(fare...\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=86"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=87"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=88"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=89"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=90"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=91"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762008654184_1104084380","id":"paragraph_1762008654184_1104084380","dateCreated":"2025-11-01T14:50:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T01:28:27+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-07T01:28:51+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false},{"text":"%md\r\n### Ref. ‘2.4.1.1 Target queries’ in report.\r\n#### Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y)\r\nThe cell below takes out the relevant columns from the `tlc_final` dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table `trips_by_day_zone`.  \r\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it's directly being exported to the corresponding table.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T01:05:52+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"editorHide":true,"tableHide":false},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Ref. ‘2.4.1.1 Target queries’ in report.</h3>\n<h4>Trips by pickup date (e.g., all trips starting in zone X on day Y)</h4>\n<p>The cell below takes out the relevant columns from the <code>tlc_final</code> dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table <code>trips_by_day_zone</code>.<br />\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it&rsquo;s directly being exported to the corresponding table.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762012177949_2109964072","id":"paragraph_1762012177949_2109964072","dateCreated":"2025-11-01T15:49:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T01:05:52+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-07T01:05:52+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\r\nval trips_by_day_zone_df = tlc_final\r\n    .select(\r\n        col(\"pickup_date\"),\r\n        col(\"pickup_location_name\").as(\"pickup_zone\")\r\n    )\r\n    .withColumn(\"pickup_date\", to_date(col(\"pickup_date\"), \"yyyy-MM-dd\"))\r\n    .groupBy(\"pickup_date\", \"pickup_zone\")\r\n    .agg(count(\"*\").cast(\"Integer\").as(\"number_of_trips\"))\r\n    .orderBy(\"pickup_date\", \"pickup_zone\")\r\n\r\ntrips_by_day_zone_df.write\r\n    .format(\"org.apache.spark.sql.cassandra\")\r\n    .options(Map(\r\n        \"table\" -> \"trips_by_day_zone\",\r\n        \"keyspace\" -> \"tlc_ks\"\r\n    ))\r\n    .mode(\"append\")\r\n    .save()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:10+0000","progress":11,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrips_by_day_zone_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [pickup_date: date, pickup_zone: string ... 1 more field]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=74"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=75"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=76"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=77"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=78"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=79"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762034070759_1546874332","id":"paragraph_1762034070759_1546874332","dateCreated":"2025-11-01T21:54:30+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T00:17:40+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-07T00:18:40+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\r\n#### Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts)\r\nThe cell below takes out the relevant columns from the `tlc_final` dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table `top_dropoff_zones_by_pickup_zone`.  \r\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it's directly being exported to the corresponding table.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-06T16:31:41+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Top drop-off zones for a pickup zone (with counts)</h4>\n<p>The cell below takes out the relevant columns from the <code>tlc_final</code> dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table <code>top_dropoff_zones_by_pickup_zone</code>.<br />\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it&rsquo;s directly being exported to the corresponding table.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762034851023_1267654086","id":"paragraph_1762034851023_1267654086","dateCreated":"2025-11-01T22:07:31+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-06T16:31:42+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-06T16:31:42+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval filter_dropof = tlc_final\n    .select(\n        col(\"pickup_location_name\").as(\"pickup_zone\"),\n        col(\"dropoff_location_name\").as(\"dropoff_zone\")\n    )\n    .groupBy(\"pickup_zone\", \"dropoff_zone\")\n    .agg(\n        count(\"*\").as(\"trips\")\n    )\n    .withColumn(\n        \"rank\",\n        rank().over(Window.partitionBy(\"pickup_zone\").orderBy(desc(\"trips\")))\n    )\n    .where(col(\"rank\") === 1)\n    .drop(\"rank\")\n    .orderBy(desc(\"trips\"))\n\n\nfilter_dropof.write\n    .format(\"org.apache.spark.sql.cassandra\")\n    .options(Map(\n        \"table\" -> \"top_dropoff_zones_by_pickup_zone\",\n        \"keyspace\" -> \"tlc_ks\"\n    ))\n    .mode(\"append\")\n    .save()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:15+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mfilter_dropof\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [pickup_zone: string, dropoff_zone: string ... 1 more field]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=12"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=13"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=14"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=15"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=16"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=17"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762042608430_1908574658","id":"paragraph_1762042608430_1908574658","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T00:16:48+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-06T16:31:42+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-06T16:34:07+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\r\n#### Daily revenue per borough\r\nThe cell below takes out the relevant columns from the `tlc_final` dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table `daily_revenue_by_borough`.  \r\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it's directly being exported to the corresponding table.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-06T16:34:07+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"editorHide":true,"tableHide":false},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>Daily revenue per borough</h4>\n<p>The cell below takes out the relevant columns from the <code>tlc_final</code> dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table <code>daily_revenue_by_borough</code>.<br />\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it&rsquo;s directly being exported to the corresponding table.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762044827160_249678275","id":"paragraph_1762044827160_249678275","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T00:53:47+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-06T16:34:07+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-06T16:34:08+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval daily_revenue_by_borough_df = tlc_final\n    .select(\n        col(\"PU_Borough\").as(\"borough\"),\n        col(\"pickup_date\").as(\"day\"),\n        col(\"total_amount\")\n    )\n    .withColumn(\"day\", to_date(col(\"day\"), \"yyyy-MM-dd\"))\n    .groupBy(\"day\", \"borough\")\n    .agg(sum(\"total_amount\").cast(\"float\").as(\"revenue\"))\n    .orderBy(\"day\")\n\ndaily_revenue_by_borough_df.write\n    .format(\"org.apache.spark.sql.cassandra\")\n    .options(Map(\n        \"table\" -> \"daily_revenue_by_borough\",\n        \"keyspace\" -> \"tlc_ks\"\n    ))\n    .mode(\"append\")\n    .save()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:18+0000","progress":11,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdaily_revenue_by_borough_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.Dataset[org.apache.spark.sql.Row]\u001b[0m = [day: date, borough: string ... 1 more field]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=18"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=19"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=20"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=21"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=22"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=23"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762094300931_2004626369","id":"paragraph_1762094300931_2004626369","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T14:38:20+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-06T16:34:08+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-06T16:36:30+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%md\r\n### Ref. ‘2.4.1.2 Activity’ in report.\r\n#### Clustering columns for sorting by drop-off or fare\r\nThe cell below takes out the relevant columns from the `tlc_final` dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table `trips_by_day_zone_dropoff` and `trips_by_day_zone_fare`.  \r\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it's directly being exported to the corresponding table.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:22+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Ref. ‘2.4.1.2 Activity’ in report.</h3>\n<h4>Clustering columns for sorting by drop-off or fare</h4>\n<p>The cell below takes out the relevant columns from the <code>tlc_final</code> dataframe and aggregates it to fit the table structure for the Cassandra table <code>trips_by_day_zone_dropoff</code> and <code>trips_by_day_zone_fare</code>.<br />\nAfter the dataframe is complete, it&rsquo;s directly being exported to the corresponding table.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762094775201_1579029624","id":"paragraph_1762094775201_1579029624","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T14:46:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-06T16:36:30+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-06T16:36:31+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\r\nval dropoff_and_fare_df = tlc_final\r\n    .select(\r\n        col(\"pickup_date\"),\r\n        col(\"pickup_location_name\").as(\"pickup_zone\"),\r\n        col(\"dropoff_location_name\").as(\"dropoff_zone\"),\r\n        col(\"total_amount\").as(\"fare_amount\")\r\n    )\r\n    .withColumn(\"pickup_date\", to_date(col(\"pickup_date\"), \"yyyy-MM-dd\"))\r\n    .withColumn(\"fare_amount\", col(\"fare_amount\").cast(\"float\"))\r\n\r\nval dropoff_df = dropoff_and_fare_df\r\n    .select(\"pickup_date\", \"pickup_zone\", \"dropoff_zone\")\r\n    .groupBy(\"dropoff_zone\", \"pickup_date\", \"pickup_zone\")\r\n    .agg(count(\"*\").cast(\"Integer\").as(\"trips\"))\r\n\r\nval fare_df = dropoff_and_fare_df.drop(col(\"dropoff_zone\"))\r\n\r\ndropoff_df.write\r\n    .format(\"org.apache.spark.sql.cassandra\")\r\n    .options(Map(\r\n        \"table\" -> \"trips_by_day_zone_dropoff\",\r\n        \"keyspace\" -> \"tlc_ks\"\r\n    ))\r\n    .mode(\"append\")\r\n    .save()\r\n\r\nfare_df.write\r\n    .format(\"org.apache.spark.sql.cassandra\")\r\n    .options(Map(\r\n        \"table\" -> \"trips_by_day_zone_fare\",\r\n        \"keyspace\" -> \"tlc_ks\"\r\n    ))\r\n    .mode(\"append\")\r\n    .save()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-07T03:39:29+0000","progress":100,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdropoff_and_fare_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [pickup_date: date, pickup_zone: string ... 2 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mdropoff_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [dropoff_zone: string, pickup_date: date ... 2 more fields]\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mfare_df\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.DataFrame\u001b[0m = [pickup_date: date, pickup_zone: string ... 1 more field]\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=102"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=103"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=104"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=105"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=106"},{"jobUrl":"http://localhost:4040/jobs/job?id=107"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762094865457_497858288","id":"paragraph_1762094865457_497858288","dateCreated":"2025-11-02T14:47:45+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-07T03:12:24+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-07T03:22:26+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false}],"name":"TLC_Frame_to_Table","id":"2M8F7J73B","defaultInterpreterGroup":"spark","version":"0.12.0","noteParams":{},"noteForms":{},"angularObjects":{},"config":{"isZeppelinNotebookCronEnable":false,"looknfeel":"default","personalizedMode":"false"},"info":{"isRunning":false},"path":"/TLC_Frame_to_Table"}